  "scope": "12 real local CPU encodes, two retained synthetic 9s 1440x810 30fps H264/AAC inputs, x264 veryfast 1791kbps threads4, Linux FFmpeg7.1.5 CPU quota4. Three alternating-order pairs of two-job queues. Serial encodes and verifies one job before next. Overlap has exactly one encoder and one validation worker, next encode starts after first encoder closes, verification of preceding output concurrently; both joined, no publication, temporary files removed. Validation compares independent source FFprobe clocks to strict CPU decoded output clock, concurrent source/output audio packet checks incl duration/hash, exact source and reference output SHA, 270 frames and 423 audio packets each. Oracle precomputed outside wall timer; no C# workflow, GPU or contention generalization. 3 pairs, all faster but median below 15% gate. No policy promotion. Local harness not yet uploaded.",
